GET Get Regional By Nome
    [Documentation]    Sends a GET request to fetch a Regional unit by its nome and returns the response.
    [Arguments]    ${nome}
    # ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    Get Mais Saude Publica Session

    ${response}=    GET On Session
    ...    msp_session
    ...    ${BASE_URL}${REGIONAL_ENDPOINT}/${nome}
    ...    expected_status=ANY

    Log    ${response.status_code}
    Log    ${response.text}

    RETURN    ${response}
